\ Exercises a user-defined parameter under runtime-image AOT. The
\ compound body of `my-param` is `push_literal { .parameter = p }`;
\ routing the push through the parameter slot table preserves pointer
\ identity across freeze and runtime so two consecutive calls to
\ `my-param` return the same `*Parameter`. The default quotation runs
\ on `get` when no binding is in scope.

my-param: parameter{ [ 42 ] } ;

my-param my-param = .
my-param get .
